tailscale-mycloud
=================

This project packages Tailscale as an installable app for Western Digital
My Cloud (OS5) NAS devices. It bundles and builds on third-party components:

1. mksapkg-OS5
   - Source: https://github.com/WDCommunity/wdpksrc
   - License: BSD 3-Clause (Copyright (c) 2018, WDCommunity)
   - The packaging tool that produces the WD `.bin` (APKG) format. Vendored as
     a prebuilt Linux x86-64 binary and executed only inside the build Docker
     image. Not modified.

2. Package structure / scripts
   - Modeled on the ZeroTier package from WDCommunity/wdpksrc (BSD 3-Clause),
     which targets the My Cloud EX2 Ultra on OS5.

3. Tailscale (tailscaled, tailscale)
   - Source: https://github.com/tailscale/tailscale  (https://tailscale.com)
   - License: BSD 3-Clause (Copyright (c) Tailscale Inc & AUTHORS)
   - NOT vendored in this repository. The official static `arm` build is
     downloaded from https://pkgs.tailscale.com at build time and verified
     against its published SHA-256 checksum before being placed in the package.

